{"id":"40541a5ccd6c3fdc","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-vl-random-join-no-upper.md","title":"随机直和的两个列没有共同van Lambalgen上界","display":"thm-vl-random-join-no-upper — 随机直和的两个列没有共同van Lambalgen上界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-vl-random-join-no-upper","aliases":["43-thm-vl-random-join-no-upper"],"display":"thm-vl-random-join-no-upper — 随机直和的两个列没有共同van Lambalgen上界","depends_on":["[[43-df-vl-red]]","[[43-df-turing-join]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Theorem 14.4.4(iii); Corollary 14.4.5(ii); printed p.397 / PDF p.417","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-vl-random-join-no-upper"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-vl-random-join-no-upper</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-vl-random-join-no-upper — 随机直和的两个列没有共同van Lambalgen上界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d6812f594e37d97c\" href=\"?note=d6812f594e37d97c\" title=\"43-df-vl-red\">43-df-vl-red</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 14.4.4(iii); Corollary 14.4.5(ii); printed p.397 / PDF p.417"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X,Y\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\oplus\">\\(\\oplus\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}},&lt;_{\\mathrm{vL}}\">\\(\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}},&lt;_{\\mathrm{vL}}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"be1278f108eb178d\" href=\"?note=be1278f108eb178d\" title=\"43-df-turing-join\">43-df-turing-join</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d6812f594e37d97c\" href=\"?note=d6812f594e37d97c\" title=\"43-df-vl-red\">43-df-vl-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X\\oplus Y)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\exists Z\\in2^\\omega\\;(X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Z\\land Y\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Z).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X\\oplus Y)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\exists Z\\in2^\\omega\\;(X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Z\\land Y\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Z).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X\\oplus Y)\\Rightarrow\\bigl(X\\oplus Y&lt;_{\\mathrm{vL}}X\\land X\\oplus Y&lt;_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y\\land\\neg(X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y)\\land\\neg(Y\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}X)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X\\oplus Y)\\Rightarrow\\bigl(X\\oplus Y&lt;_{\\mathrm{vL}}X\\land X\\oplus Y&lt;_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y\\land\\neg(X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y)\\land\\neg(Y\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}X)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若Z为共同上界，依次对两次随机直和应用归约，会使Z⊕Z随机；重复两列形成的有效闭零类给出矛盾。这是无共同上界，强于仅仅没有最小上界。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 14.4.4(iii); Corollary 14.4.5(ii); printed p.397 / PDF p.417。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-vl-red","status":"resolved","id":"d6812f594e37d97c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-vl-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1278f108eb178d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-join]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-join","status":"resolved","id":"be1278f108eb178d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y\\in2^\\omega$；$\\oplus$、$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}},<_{\\mathrm{vL}}$ 见 [[43-df-turing-join]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-vl-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y\\in2^\\omega$；$\\oplus$、$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}},<_{\\mathrm{vL}}$ 见 [[43-df-turing-join]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-vl-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-vl-red","status":"resolved","id":"d6812f594e37d97c","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$X,Y\\in2^\\omega$；$\\oplus$、$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、$\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}},<_{\\mathrm{vL}}$ 见 [[43-df-turing-join]]、[[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-vl-red]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y\\in2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\oplus","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}},<_{\\mathrm{vL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X\\oplus Y)\\Rightarrow\\neg\\exists Z\\in2^\\omega\\;(X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Z\\land Y\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Z).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X\\oplus Y)\\Rightarrow\\bigl(X\\oplus Y<_{\\mathrm{vL}}X\\land X\\oplus Y<_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y\\land\\neg(X\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}Y)\\land\\neg(Y\\le_{\\mathrm{vL}}X)\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1747,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-337","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-vl-random-join-no-upper]] — 随机直和的两个列没有共同van Lambalgen上界"}],"outgoing":["d6812f594e37d97c","be1278f108eb178d","0586e0fd0301d605"]}